    <description>When a new campaign member is added to the campaign &quot;Evergreen - Lead High Fill Rate States - Added to Cadence&quot;, remove the related Lead/Contact from the &quot;Evergreen - Lead High Fill Rate States&quot; campaign. 
This ensure we are removing leads/contacts from the Evergreen - Lead High Fill Rate States once they have been added to a cadence once, so we can keep using that campaign to identify only new Leads/Contacts that should be added to a cadence. (S3P-1088)
S3P-1114 - Update campaign member status to reflect number or re-entries into the &quot;Evergreen - Lead High Fill Rate States - Added to Cadence&quot;campaign
Hot-fix - Updated Campaign Member status decision element so that More than 5 is set if previous value is &quot;5&quot; or &quot;More than 5&quot;</description>
